**Prepared By:** Sales Cowboy Marketing Solutions  
**Date:** November 10, 2026  

---

## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW
The platform is an on-demand ad space marketplace bridging two primary market participants:
1. **Advertisers & Vendors:** Businesses seeking to place promotional campaigns across physical locations (hotel lobbies, shopping malls, corporate offices, restaurants) and mobile transit corridors (commercial vehicles, taxis, buses).
2. **Outpost Hosts:** Property managers, business owners, and commercial vehicle operators looking to monetize their existing TV screens, LED boards, and vehicle exterior surfaces.

The system provides an automated booking engine, built-in AI creative design tools, and a multi-stage proof-of-placement verification workflow to protect campaign investments.

---

## 2. FUNCTIONAL SYSTEM SPECIFICATIONS

### Module 1: Advertiser / Vendor Portal (Web & Mobile)
* **Outpost Marketplace & Discovery:**
  * Search and filter ad spaces by city, corridor, venue type (Hotels, Malls, Banks, Gyms, Airports), and vehicle transit routes.
  * View outpost profile metrics: estimated daily foot traffic, screen dimensions, operating hours, and daily/weekly/monthly pricing.
* **In-App AI Creative Generation Studio:**
  * **AI Flyer Creator:** Input business details, offer text, and theme prompts to automatically generate professional display flyers.
  * **Media Uploader:** Upload custom existing flyers, images, or short MP4 video jingles.
* **Campaign Booking & Escrow Checkout:**
  * Select campaign duration (e.g., 7 days, 30 days) or vehicle wrap slot.
  * Secure in-app payment via Paystack/Moniepoint, held in platform escrow until placement is verified.
* **Proof-of-Placement Feed:** Real-time dashboard showing photo/video proof submitted by outpost owners confirming the ad is live.

### Module 2: Outpost Host Portal (Screens & Vehicles)
* **Outpost Space Listing:**
  * Register screen displays (Smart TV, LED billboard, reception display) or vehicle assets (saloon car, minibus, commercial taxi).
  * Define location, pricing schedule, and upload photos of the screen or vehicle.
* **Campaign Acceptance & Media Delivery:**
  * Receive booking alerts with approved media files (images or video clips).
  * Download approved media for Smart TV playback or load via the platform web-player link.
* **Proof-of-Play Submission Gate:**
  * Mandatory upload of photo/video evidence showing the ad active on the screen or the installed vehicle wrap to release milestone payments.
* **Earnings & Payout Wallet:** Real-time visibility into active campaign earnings, completed campaigns, and automated withdrawals to local bank accounts.

### Module 3: Transit Wrap & Field Operations Workflow
* **Branding Syndicate Desk:** Automated dispatch desk for professional vinyl installation agents to coordinate vehicle drop-off, material pickup, and application.
* **Installation Sign-Off:** Field technician and driver dual sign-off with multi-angle vehicle inspection photos before campaign activation.

### Module 4: Master Admin Operations & Marketplace Desk
* **Listing Verification:** Review and approve or reject new screens, venues, and vehicle submissions before public listing.
* **Ad Content Moderation:** Automated and manual review queue to filter out prohibited materials (nudity, fraudulent schemes, unauthorized promotions) before media reaches host screens.
* **Commission & Financial Settlement Engine:** Configure platform service commission splits (e.g., 15% to 25% retained by the platform per booking), manage automated payout batches, and handle refund disputes.
* **Campaign Performance Ledger:** Comprehensive tracking of live, upcoming, and expired campaigns across all registered cities.

