## 3. TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE & STACK
* **Web & Client Application:** **Next.js 15 (React)** with Tailwind CSS, delivered as a responsive Progressive Web App (PWA) installable on mobile phones and desktop computers.
* **Backend API & Workflows:** **Node.js (NestJS)** hosted on **Railway**, handling booking state machines, proof verification queues, and role-based permissions.
* **Database & File Storage:** **PostgreSQL** on Railway for transactional ledgers, combined with **Cloudflare R2** for zero-egress video and high-resolution graphic storage.
* **AI Integration:** Secure backend interface to generative AI image and text models for the in-app flyer creator module.

